	)
	(text "USB\nFit USB301 (on board) or J301 + the USB-C board, not both. The USB-C board has its own\n5.1k CC resistors and USBLC6-2SC6.\nCH340C runs from its own XC6206 (3.3 V from VBUS): no battery drain without USB.\nV3 tied to VCC (3.3 V supply); R232 low; CTS/DSR/RI/DCD unused (internal pull-ups).\nTX/RX through 470R. Auto-reset: DTR/RTS both low or both high = idle; the usual\nesptool sequence pulls EN or IO0 low (GPIO0 is also the codec's MCLK, as on the Audio Kit)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
